  "html": "<article id=\"post-6469\" class=\"container post-6469 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-uncategorized\">\n<div class=\"breadcrumbs\">\n<a href=\"/about-us/blog\" data-cta-gap=\"md\" data-cta-type=\"outline\" data-cta-content=\"mixed\" data-cta-minwidth=\"true\" class=\"cta\">\n    <svg class=\"icon cta-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevronleft\" /></svg><span >Blog Posts</span>\n\n</a></div>\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\t\t<h1 class=\"entry-title has-secondary-color mt-3\">PlumbV Is Now Happy Home Services</h1>\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-meta\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"posted-on p-sm\">Published on <span><time class=\"entry-date published\" datetime=\"2026-07-07T19:35:30+00:00\">July 7, 2026</time><time class=\"updated\" datetime=\"2026-08-12T18:53:05+00:00\">August 12, 2026</time></span></span>\t\t\t</div><!-- .entry-meta -->\n\t\t\t</header><!-- .entry-header -->\n\n\t\t\t<figure class=\"post-thumbnail\">\n\t\t\t\t<img width=\"2560\" height=\"1707\" src=\"/images/2026/06/NU-HappyHome_Group-Shot-4-scaled.jpg\" class=\"attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image\" alt=\"Happy Home Services group shot\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"/images/2026/06/NU-HappyHome_Group-Shot-4-scaled.jpg 2560w, /images/2026/06/NU-HappyHome_Group-Shot-4-300x200.jpg 300w, /images/2026/06/NU-HappyHome_Group-Shot-4-1024x683.jpg 1024w, /images/2026/06/NU-HappyHome_Group-Shot-4-768x512.jpg 768w, /images/2026/06/NU-HappyHome_Group-Shot-4-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, /images/2026/06/NU-HappyHome_Group-Shot-4-2048x1365.jpg 2048w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1010px) 100vw, (max-width: 1440px) 50vw, 768px\" />\t\t\t</figure><!-- .post-thumbnail -->\n\n\t<div class=\"entry-content | asymmetric-container | mb-5\">\n\t\t<div class=\"asymmetric-main blog--main flow\">\n\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Same dependable service for your Durham home, now with more ways to take care of it.</h1>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">If you&#8217;ve relied on PlumbV since 2009, here&#8217;s what you need to know: starting February 2026, that team became a part of Happy Home Services. The name on the truck is new, but the plumbing and drain service you&#8217;ve come to expect hasn&#8217;t gone anywhere, and the phone number is the same one PlumbV customers already have. Here&#8217;s what&#8217;s staying the same, what&#8217;s new, and who to call the next time something needs fixing.</p>\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">What Stays the Same for PlumbV&#8217;s Customers</h2>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Your appointment process and service area are unchanged. PlumbV built its reputation on water heater installation and repair, toilet and faucet repair, drain cleaning, and emergency plumbing for residential and commercial customers across Durham, Raleigh, Chapel Hill, Cary, Apex, Morrisville, and beyond. Happy Home Services&#8217;&nbsp;<a href=\"/services/plumbing\">plumbing service</a>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<a href=\"/services/drains\">drain service</a>&nbsp;cover that same ground, with the same standard of licensed work and a warranty on every job.</p>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"200\" src=\"/images/2026/06/brand-transition.png\" alt=\"PlumbV / Happy Home Services brand transition\" class=\"wp-image-6476\" srcset=\"/images/2026/06/brand-transition.png 1024w, /images/2026/06/brand-transition-300x59.png 300w, /images/2026/06/brand-transition-768x150.png 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" /></figure>\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">What&#8217;s New</h2>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Happy Home Services brings a little more to the table. Along with plumbing and drains, the Durham location now offers&nbsp;<a href=\"/services/heating\">heating service</a>&nbsp;for furnace repair, installation, and maintenance,&nbsp;<a href=\"/services/cooling\">cooling service</a>&nbsp;for AC repair and tune-ups, and&nbsp;<a href=\"/services/indoor-air-quality\">indoor air quality service</a>&nbsp;for air filtration and humidity control.</p>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">That means plumbing and HVAC are now available from one company, with same-day appointments and easy online scheduling for either. One company, one phone number, a lot more of your home&#8217;s needs covered.</p>\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Happy Home Services: A Name Durham Has Trusted Since 1955</h2>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Happy Home Services has cared for homes across Durham, Chapel Hill, Raleigh, and Alamance County since 1955. Technicians are NATE-certified and background-checked, every visit comes with transparent, upfront pricing, and 24/7 emergency service means a plumbing or HVAC emergency never has to wait for business hours. Customers who join the maintenance membership get priority scheduling and regular checkups designed to catch small issues before they turn into expensive ones.&nbsp; </p>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"/about-us\">Get to know Happy Home Services</a>, or take a look at&nbsp;<a href=\"/special-coupon-offers-and-promotions\">current service offers</a>!<br></p>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"684\" src=\"/images/2024/03/A-Happy-Home-Services-technician-behind-the-wheel-of-a-Happy-Home-Services-van-1024x684.jpg\" alt=\"A Happy Home Services technician behind the wheel of a Happy Home Services van\" class=\"wp-image-4764\" srcset=\"/images/2024/03/A-Happy-Home-Services-technician-behind-the-wheel-of-a-Happy-Home-Services-van-1024x684.jpg 1024w, /images/2024/03/A-Happy-Home-Services-technician-behind-the-wheel-of-a-Happy-Home-Services-van-300x200.jpg 300w, /images/2024/03/A-Happy-Home-Services-technician-behind-the-wheel-of-a-Happy-Home-Services-van-768x513.jpg 768w, /images/2024/03/A-Happy-Home-Services-technician-behind-the-wheel-of-a-Happy-Home-Services-van-1536x1026.jpg 1536w, /images/2024/03/A-Happy-Home-Services-technician-behind-the-wheel-of-a-Happy-Home-Services-van.jpg 1916w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" /></figure>\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">What You Can Expect</h2>\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Trusted service: </strong>a local team with licensed installers on every job.</li>\n\n<li><strong>Quality: </strong>warrantied work, done right the first time.</li>\n\n<li><strong>Speed: </strong>same-day service and 24/7 emergency availability.</li>\n\n<li><strong>Convenience: </strong>online scheduling, so booking a repair fits your day instead of the other way around.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Questions You Might Have</h2>\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Did PlumbV close?</h3>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">No. PlumbV didn&#8217;t close. As of February 2026, PlumbV became a part of Happy Home Services,&nbsp;continuing plumbing and drain service in Durham under a new name.</p>\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Where is Happy Home Services located?</h3>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The Durham location is at 5112 Neal Road, Durham, NC 27705.</p>\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">What&#8217;s different about Happy Home Services compared to PlumbV?</h3>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">With this transition, customers who worked with PlumbV now have access to more options. Heating, cooling, and indoor air quality service are now part of the same company that handles plumbing and drains.</p>\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">We&#8217;re Ready To Help</h2>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Whether it&#8217;s a dripping faucet, a furnace that&#8217;s acting up, or an air conditioner that isn&#8217;t ready for North Carolina summers, your new local Happy Home Services location is one call away. Schedule plumbing, heating, cooling, or indoor air quality service by calling us or book online anytime.</p>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"asymmetric-side blog--sidebar\">\n\t\t\t<div  class=\"card card--post has-white-background-color has-black-color\">\n        <div class=\"card__content\">\n                    <p class=\"card__content__title card__title h3\" title=\"Have a question?\" aria-label=\"Have a question?\">Have a question?</p>\n\n                    <div class=\"card__content__description card__description\"><div class=\"flow\"><p>Let’s connect and have a quick conversation to see how we can help.</p>\n<a href=\"tel:+13362819025\" aria-label=\"Call now: +13362819025\" data-cta-gap=\"md\" data-cta-type=\"outline\" data-cta-content=\"mixed\" data-cta-minwidth=\"true\" class=\"cta phone-link\">\n    <svg class=\"icon cta-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-phone\" /></svg><span data-show-on=\"desktop\">(336) 281-9025</span>\n        <span data-show-on=\"mobile\">Call Now</span>\n</a></div></div>\n\n                </div></div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div><!-- .entry-content -->\n    <footer class=\"entry-footer container has-gray-light-background-color has-background py-5\">\n        <div>\n\t<h3 class=\"h2\">Recommended Reads:</h3>\n\t<a href=\"/about-us/blog\">Read All Blog Posts</a>\n\t<div class=\"my-4 nearu-carousel multi-component-container multi-component-container--4-up multi-component-container--uniform-height\">\n\t\t<div  class=\"card card--post has-white-background-color has-black-color\">\n<a href=\"/about-us/blog/air-conditioning-installation-costs-durham-nc\" class=\"link stretch-link\"></a>        <figure class=\"card__featured-image\">\n        <img width=\"423\" height=\"250\" src=\"/images/2026/03/17_promo-free-estimates.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"/images/2026/03/17_promo-free-estimates.jpg 423w, /images/2026/03/17_promo-free-estimates-300x177.jpg 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 423px) 100vw, 423px\" />    </figure>\n        <div class=\"card__content\">\n                    <p class=\"card__content__title card__